{"sha": "9209dee4b4fd441bf50b61fd753d21a43b647e58430f79f7adebabb187bda556", "body": ["\\chapter{条件概率与独立性}\\label{ch:g12:condprob}", "", "概率刻画不确定性；条件概率刻画", "如何改变这种不确定性。得知事件 $B$ 发生后，会重塑", "所有其他事件的概率——这一机制由贝叶斯形式化，", "并在法庭与报纸上被日常误用。本章建立条件化的规则", "与独立性的确切含义。", "", "\\section{概率空间（回顾）}", "", "有限多个结果的试验，用\\emph{样本", "空间}$\\Omega$（结果的集合）及概率 $\\P$，", "对每个事件 $A \\subseteq \\Omega$ 指定一个数 $\\P(A) \\in \\intcc{0}{1}$，", "对不相交事件之并可加，且 $\\P(\\Omega) = 1$。回忆基本法则：", "\\[", "\\P(\\bar A) = 1 - \\P(A),", "\\qquad", "\\P(A \\cup B) = \\P(A) + \\P(B) - \\P(A \\cap B).", "\\]", "当所有结果等可能时，", "$\\P(A) = \\frac{\\abs A}{\\abs\\Omega}$ ——概率的计算归结为", "\\cref{ch:g12:comb}中的计数方法。", "", "\\section{条件概率}", "", "\\begin{definition}[条件概率]\\label{def:g12:condprob:cond}", "设 $B$ 为事件，且 $\\P(B) > 0$。称 \\emph{$A$ 在", "$B$ 之下的条件概率}\\index{条件概率}为", "\\[", "\\pcond{B}{A} = \\frac{\\P(A \\cap B)}{\\P(B)} .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "映射 $A \\mapsto \\pcond BA$ 本身也是概率（前述法则全部适用），", "它表示已得知 $B$ 发生之人的", "新的知识状态。", "", "\\begin{proposition}[乘法法则]\\label{prop:g12:condprob:product}", "对于概率非零的事件：", "\\[", "\\P(A \\cap B) = \\P(B)\\,\\pcond{B}{A} = \\P(A)\\,\\pcond{A}{B},", "\\]", "更一般地，", "$\\P(A_1 \\cap A_2 \\cap A_3) = \\P(A_1)\\,\\pcond{A_1}{A_2}\\,", "\\pcond{A_1 \\cap A_2}{A_3}$，依此类推。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由定义移项即得；链式公式可由反复使用此式得到。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[全概率公式]\\label{thm:g12:condprob:total}", "\\index{全概率公式}", "设 $B_1, \\dots, B_n$ 是把 $\\Omega$ 划分为", "概率非零的事件组。对任意事件 $A$，有", "\\[", "\\P(A) = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\P(B_i)\\,\\pcond{B_i}{A}.", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "集合 $A \\cap B_i$ 两两不交，且并集为 $A$，", "因此 $\\P(A) = \\sum_i \\P(A \\cap B_i) = \\sum_i \\P(B_i)\\pcond{B_i}{A}$，由", "乘法法则可得。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[概率树]\\label{met:g12:condprob:tree}", "树状图组织条件概率：每条分支标出", "在\\emph{已知}前面路径的前提下，下一事件的概率。", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 叶（即一条完整路径）的概率，是沿其各分支概率的\\emph{乘积}，", "        即乘法法则。", "  \\item 事件的概率，是实现该事件的各叶概率的\\emph{和}，", "        即全概率公式。", "  \\item 从同一节点发出的各分支概率之和为 $1$。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\coordinate (root) at (0,0);", "  \\node (B)  at (2.6,1.2)  {$B$};", "  \\node (Bc) at (2.6,-1.2) {$\\bar B$};", "  \\node (BA)  at (5.4,1.8)  {$A$};", "  \\node (BAc) at (5.4,0.6)  {$\\bar A$};", "  \\node (BcA)  at (5.4,-0.6) {$A$};", "  \\node (BcAc) at (5.4,-1.8) {$\\bar A$};", "  \\draw (root) -- (B)  node[midway, above] {$\\P(B)$};", "  \\draw (root) -- (Bc) node[midway, below] {$\\P(\\bar B)$};", "  \\draw (B) -- (BA)   node[midway, above] {$\\pcond{B}{A}$};", "  \\draw (B) -- (BAc)  node[midway, below] {$\\pcond{B}{\\bar A}$};", "  \\draw (Bc) -- (BcA)  node[midway, above] {$\\pcond{\\bar B}{A}$};", "  \\draw (Bc) -- (BcAc) node[midway, below] {$\\pcond{\\bar B}{\\bar A}$};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (6.0,1.8)  {$\\P(A \\cap B) = \\P(B)\\,\\pcond{B}{A}$};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (6.0,0.6)  {$\\P(\\bar A \\cap B)$};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (6.0,-0.6) {$\\P(A \\cap \\bar B)$};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (6.0,-1.8) {$\\P(\\bar A \\cap \\bar B)$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 一个两层树状图：沿路径相乘，对各叶相加。", "例如 $\\P(A)$ 是第一个与第三个叶的", "概率之和。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[贝叶斯公式]\\label{thm:g12:condprob:bayes}", "\\index{贝叶斯公式}", "设 $B_1, \\dots, B_n$ 为如上所述的 $\\Omega$ 划分，$A$ 为事件，", "且 $\\P(A) > 0$。则有", "\\[", "\\pcond{A}{B_j} =", "\\frac{\\P(B_j)\\,\\pcond{B_j}{A}}{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\P(B_i)\\,\\pcond{B_i}{A}} .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}